  actor: jgstern_agent  # f3c9
  clock: 6  # f3c9
  nonce: f3c9  # f3c9
  message: "DONE — THIRD AND FINAL DELIVERABLE SHIPPED (dev a9ff904f0e). All three gaps this\nitem named are now closed:\n\n  1. per-name pairing        _source_names_can_reach_sink        (e66ab343a3)\n  2. the fetch rule          _FAR_SIDE_FETCH_COMMANDS            (e66ab343a3)\n  3. cross-`source` reach    _RepoBashIndex                      (a9ff904f0e)\n\nDELIVERABLE 3, and the design is NOT the one this item predicted. \"Follow the\nsource/. edges bash.py already emits\" reaches only 12 of the cohort's 97\nsource/. statements: 80 (82.5%) are a variable or command substitution. What\nmakes it tractable is that those are dynamic in the PREFIX and literal in the\nTAIL (`source $TOOL_LIB_PATH/gitlib.sh`), so matching the trailing literal\ncomponent lifts 12 to 81 of 97 (83.5%) with zero ambiguity, and matching a\nglob's trailing DIRECTORY component recovers guacamole's container-path loop.\nPropagation runs BOTH ways along the edge because bash is dynamically scoped --\ncilium's PROG is assigned at check-stable:19 and read inside the k8s-common.sh\nthat file sources, which a sourcer->sourced rule alone would have missed.\n\nCUMULATIVE COHORT EFFECT of this item's three deliverables, every arm cold:\n  deliverable 1 (16 repos)   16 rows removed, 0 added, no verdict category moved\n  deliverable 2 (15 repos)   19 rows removed cumulative, 0 new findings\n  deliverable 3 (16 repos)    8 rows removed, 0 added, no verdict category moved\n                              bash-sourced evidence rows 32 -> 24\nEvery removed row across all three was read back against repository source.\n\nTAG `awaits_bakeoff_validation` LEFT ON DELIBERATELY: the quantitative claims\nabove are A/B measurements on a fixed 16-repo cohort, not bakeoff validation,\nand the tag is the queue's single source of truth until a bakeoff moves them.\n\nRESIDUAL, filed rather than chased: WI-zihuf covers the 13 source statements\nwith no literal tail (bare $ENV_FILE / $f) plus 5 whose tail names no repo file.\nINV-pujob is satisfied on its filed row with behavioural evidence on the merged\ntree."  # f3c9
